{"id":"e75f29d6e93620d5","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup.md","title":"ZFC Ana Heat Semigroup","display":"df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup — ZFC Ana Heat Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup"],"display":"df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup — ZFC Ana Heat Semigroup","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ana-heat-semigroup — ZFC Ana Heat Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,T,\\Delta,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert\\in V\">\\(X,T,\\Delta,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (fully explicit predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroup}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroup}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}heat\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S(T,\\Delta,X,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},X^X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T(t);X,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert,+,\\cdot;X,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert,+,\\cdot;K)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(T(0)(x)=x)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(T(s+t)=T(s)\\circ T(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\left(\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\lVert T(t)(x)-x\\rVert=0\\right)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\Delta,\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta),X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta)=\\left\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in X\\;\n\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\lVert t^{-1}\\cdot(T(t)(x)-x)-y\\right\\rVert=0\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta)\\;\\left(\n\\Delta(x)=\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}t^{-1}\\cdot(T(t)(x)-x)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}heat\\text{-}semigroup\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S(T,\\Delta,X,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(T,\\mathbb R_{\\geq0},X^X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S(T(t);X,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert,+,\\cdot;X,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert,+,\\cdot;K)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(T(0)(x)=x)\n\\land\\forall s,t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;(T(s+t)=T(s)\\circ T(t))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\left(\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\lVert T(t)(x)-x\\rVert=0\\right)\n\\land\\operatorname{Function}(\\Delta,\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta),X)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta)=\\left\\{x\\in X:\\exists y\\in X\\;\n\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}\\left\\lVert t^{-1}\\cdot(T(t)(x)-x)-y\\right\\rVert=0\\right\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\Delta)\\;\\left(\n\\Delta(x)=\\lim_{t\\downarrow0}t^{-1}\\cdot(T(t)(x)-x)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}heat\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroup}_S(T,\\Delta,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S(T,\\Delta,X,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ana\\text{-}heat\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroup}_S(T,\\Delta,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S(T,\\Delta,X,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The explicit predicate forces every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t)\">\\(T(t)\\)</span>, all limits, and the generator to use one common Banach-space structure. The three-place form is its existential compatibility alias.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-bounded-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,T,\\Delta,K,+,\\cdot,\\lVert\\cdot\\rVert\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\subseteq V^{10}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroupStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAnaHeatSemigroup}_S